{"title": "Polearm Master: Bonus Attack", "pageid": 22750, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Polearm_Master:_Bonus_Attack", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp/300px-Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp, /w/images/3/31/Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp/300px-Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Polearm Master: Bonus Attack</b> is a passive feature provided by the <a href=\"/wiki/Polearm_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Polearm Master\">Polearm Master</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Feat\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Feat\">Feat</a>. When attacking with a polearm, you can make an additional weaker attack with the butt of the polearm using a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When attacking with a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Glaives\" title=\"Glaives\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/25px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/38px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/50px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Glaive\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png/25px-Glaives_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Glaives_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Glaives\" title=\"Glaives\">Glaive</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Halberds\" title=\"Halberds\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png/25px-Halberds_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png/38px-Halberds_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png/50px-Halberds_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Halberd\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png/25px-Halberds_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b5/Halberds_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Halberds\" title=\"Halberds\">Halberd</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pikes\" title=\"Pikes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/25px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/38px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/50px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png/25px-Pikes_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/72/Pikes_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pikes\" title=\"Pikes\">Pike</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quarterstaves\" title=\"Quarterstaves\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Quarterstaves_Icon.png/25px-Quarterstaves_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Quarterstaves_Icon.png/38px-Quarterstaves_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/bb/Quarterstaves_Icon.png/50px-Quarterstaves_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Quarterstaff\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/bb/Quarterstaves_Icon.png/25px-Quarterstaves_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/bb/Quarterstaves_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Quarterstaves\" title=\"Quarterstaves\">Quarterstaff</a>, or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spears\" title=\"Spears\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Spears_Icon.png/25px-Spears_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Spears_Icon.png/38px-Spears_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a1/Spears_Icon.png/50px-Spears_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spear\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a1/Spears_Icon.png/25px-Spears_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/a1/Spears_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spears\" title=\"Spears\">Spear</a>, you can use a <a href=\"/wiki/Bonus_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bonus Action\">Bonus Action</a> to attack with the butt of your weapon.\n</p>\nThis attack does <div class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 30px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> </span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">1d4 (1~4) + <a href=\"/wiki/Damage_Roll#Modifiers\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Damage Roll\">Strength or Dexterity modifier</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bludgeoning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7d/Bludgeoning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Bludgeoning\" title=\"Bludgeoning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-bludgeoning\">Bludgeoning</span></a></span> </div> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Polearm_Clout\" title=\"Polearm Clout\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/60px-Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2d/Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/80px-Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Polearm Clout\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2d/Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp/40px-Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2d/Polearm_Master_Bonus_Attack_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Polearm_Clout\" title=\"Polearm Clout\">Polearm Clout</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the feats:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Polearm_Master\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Polearm Master\">Polearm Master</a>\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The damage modifier of this attack uses <a href=\"/wiki/Strength\" title=\"Strength\">Strength</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Dexterity\" title=\"Dexterity\">Dexterity</a>, whichever is higher, even if the weapon does not have the <a href=\"/wiki/Finesse\" title=\"Finesse\">finesse</a> property, or Charisma in the case of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade\" title=\"Pact of the Blade\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/38px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/50px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Pact of the Blade\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp/25px-Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5f/Pact_of_the_Blade_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Pact_of_the_Blade\" title=\"Pact of the Blade\">Pact of the Blade</a>/<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bind_Hexed_Weapon\" title=\"Bind Hexed Weapon\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/38px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/50px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bind Hexed Weapon\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp/25px-Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/35/Bind_Pact_Weapon_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bind_Hexed_Weapon\" title=\"Bind Hexed Weapon\">Bind Hexed Weapon</a>. It does not change to spellcasting modifier in the case of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shillelagh\" title=\"Shillelagh\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Shillelagh_Icon.webp/25px-Shillelagh_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Shillelagh_Icon.webp/38px-Shillelagh_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/Shillelagh_Icon.webp/50px-Shillelagh_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shillelagh\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/Shillelagh_Icon.webp/25px-Shillelagh_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/Shillelagh_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shillelagh\" title=\"Shillelagh\">Shillelagh</a>.</li>\n<li>It is not stated in-game but Polearm Mastery works with Pikes too. Polearm Master is coded to work with any weapon that is tagged as a SPEAR or STAVE (quarterstaffs), and weapons with <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Reach\" title=\"Extra Reach\">Extra Reach</a> (Glaives, Halberds and <b>Pikes</b>)</li>\n<li>This attack can only be triggered once per turn. Therefore, a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Thief\" title=\"Thief\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Class_Rogue_Thief_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Rogue_Thief_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Class_Rogue_Thief_Hotbar_Icon.png/38px-Class_Rogue_Thief_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/e/ee/Class_Rogue_Thief_Hotbar_Icon.png/50px-Class_Rogue_Thief_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Thief\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Class_Rogue_Thief_Hotbar_Icon.png/25px-Class_Rogue_Thief_Hotbar_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Class_Rogue_Thief_Hotbar_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Thief\" title=\"Thief\">Thief</a> who gains <a href=\"/wiki/Extra_Attack\" title=\"Extra Attack\">Extra Attack</a> through multiclassing cannot twice benefit from <i>Polearm Master: Bonus Attack</i>, even though they have two bonus actions. This behaviour is different from that of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Martial Arts: Bonus Unarmed Strike\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/38px-Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/50px-Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Martial Arts: Bonus Unarmed Strike\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp/25px-Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/91/Martial_Arts_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Martial_Arts:_Bonus_Unarmed_Strike\" title=\"Martial Arts: Bonus Unarmed Strike\">Martial Arts: Bonus Unarmed Strike</a>, which can be used twice (e.g., by attacking with an action, making a bonus action attack, then making the attack granted by Extra Attack, then making a second bonus action attack.)</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201011\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.063 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3214/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 27122/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14763/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/7